WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.668
Keep the sender with the message
A coordinator is waiting for the graph agent’s report.

2
00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:07.328
See who sent the update
Graph worktree projection’s report appears with its name and a link back to its terminal.

3
00:00:07.328 --> 00:00:11.945
Open the source
One action takes you to the terminal that sent the message.

4
00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:14.945
Attribution works both ways
The original request identifies Release coordinator and links back to its terminal.

5
00:00:14.945 --> 00:00:19.300
Follow the request back
Click Release coordinator’s source link to return to the coordinating agent.

6
00:00:20.652 --> 00:00:23.341
Source links work on mobile too
The same sender label and source action, in a phone-sized browser.

7
00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:25.585
Tap to return to Graph worktree projection
One action takes you to the terminal that sent the message.

8
00:00:25.585 --> 00:00:27.900
Attribution works both ways
The original request identifies Release coordinator and links back to its terminal.
